 "attributes": {
  "title": {
   "en": "Hand Over the Money! Underworld Capital"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ko": "돈 내놔! 저승 캐피탈"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "The underworld has become a capitalist society.\n\nOne must settle their debts, even in death.\n\n“Wait, you’re saying I can’t move on to the afterlife until I settle my debt?”\n\nCheon Jae-hak died drowning in debt. That news hit him like a ton of bricks right after dying!\n\nJae-hak, with his taekwondo skills, will join Underworld Capital to collect money from wandering spirits.\n\nFrom a debtor to the youngest member of a financial firm!\n\nAlright, I’ll earn money and pay off my debt!\n\nA crazy, overpowered occultist who’ll pay off his debt by beating up ghosts!?\n\nHey, this actually pays pretty well!"
  },
